ChangeLog
==========

## Version 0.6 


- 2019-12-13 started
- adding probabilities using bootstrapping
- percentage fixes in documentation
- plotting broken lines for prob < 0.5

## Version 0.7.2

- asg.ll added for calcuation of log-likelihood
- na.omit for factor analysis
- remove of reverse same chains
- removal of short in long chains (asg.new with chains.clean option) 

## Version 0.7.3
- interactive mode for plotting
- improved layout for sam and mds by introducing invisible edges between components
- adding vignette

## Version 0.7.4
- adding asg.pcaplot

## Version 0.8.0
